{"id":"096eaa05407a0ec3","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-deterministic.md","title":"Deterministic Term","display":"df-deterministic — Deterministic Term","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-deterministic","aliases":["93-df-deterministic"],"display":"df-deterministic — Deterministic Term","depends_on":["[[93-df-term]]","[[93-df-variable]]","[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-homomorphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-deterministic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-deterministic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-deterministic — Deterministic Term"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca7404158049be33\" href=\"?note=ca7404158049be33\" title=\"93-df-term\">93-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"11b62d0ad578fa42\" href=\"?note=11b62d0ad578fa42\" title=\"93-df-variable\">93-df-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" href=\"?note=f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" title=\"93-df-homomorphism\">93-df-homomorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\">\\(\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_{93}(t;\\tau,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_{93}(t;\\tau,X)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span> with carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:X\\to A\">\\(v:X\\to A\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{App}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{App}_{93}\\)</span> is the tagged term constructor, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}\\)</span> is the explicit coordinatewise tuple-map of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" href=\"?note=f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" title=\"93-df-homomorphism\">93-df-homomorphism</a>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}\">\\(\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}\\)</span> is defined here by recursion on the construction stage of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ca7404158049be33\" href=\"?note=ca7404158049be33\" title=\"93-df-term\">93-df-term</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Deterministic}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Deterministic}_{93}\\)</span> is defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}(x)\\coloneqq v(x)\n\\quad(x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(v)),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}(\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t))\n\\coloneqq f^{\\mathbf A}\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v},\\pi_2(\\tau)(f),\\bar t\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}(x)\\coloneqq v(x)\n\\quad(x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(v)),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}(\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t))\n\\coloneqq f^{\\mathbf A}\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v},\\pi_2(\\tau)(f),\\bar t\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic}\\vdash\\mathrm{Deterministic}_{93}(t;\\tau,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Term}_{93}(t;\\tau,X)\\land\n\\forall\\mathbf A\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\to\n\\forall v:X\\to|\\mathbf A|\\;\\exists!a\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;\n(\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}(t)=a)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic}\\vdash\\mathrm{Deterministic}_{93}(t;\\tau,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Term}_{93}(t;\\tau,X)\\land\n\\forall\\mathbf A\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\to\n\\forall v:X\\to|\\mathbf A|\\;\\exists!a\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;\n(\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}(t)=a)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The recursion is well-founded on term construction depth and each basic operation is total. Its arity is read from the explicit <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>, and the variable domain is recovered from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"ca7404158049be33","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"11b62d0ad578fa42","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"f10e7e3251fa7f7d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-homomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"f10e7e3251fa7f7d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{App}_{93}$ is the tagged term constructor, $\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}$ is the explicit coordinatewise tuple-map of [[93-df-homomorphism]], and $\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}$ is defined here by recursion on the construction stage of [[93-df-term]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"ca7404158049be33","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{App}_{93}$ is the tagged term constructor, $\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}$ is the explicit coordinatewise tuple-map of [[93-df-homomorphism]], and $\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}$ is defined here by recursion on the construction stage of [[93-df-term]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Term}_{93}(t;\\tau,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"v:X\\to A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{App}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Deterministic}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}(x)\\coloneqq v(x)\n\\quad(x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(v)),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}(\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t))\n\\coloneqq f^{\\mathbf A}\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v},\\pi_2(\\tau)(f),\\bar t\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic}\\vdash\\mathrm{Deterministic}_{93}(t;\\tau,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Term}_{93}(t;\\tau,X)\\land\n\\forall\\mathbf A\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\to\n\\forall v:X\\to|\\mathbf A|\\;\\exists!a\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;\n(\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}(t)=a)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false}],"bytes":1717,"backlinks":[{"id":"55094a403a51c25e","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}$ is the recursively defined term evaluation of [[93-df-deterministic]]."},{"id":"f40774d4e625146e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}$ is the sourced term-evaluation map of [[93-df-deterministic]]."},{"id":"1a6af4ddc68cbdc4","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}$ is the term evaluation of [[93-df-deterministic]]."},{"id":"3c13cbc371598986","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf f:\\mathcal K\\to V$ is an explicit operation family, and $\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}$ is from [[93-df-deterministic]]."},{"id":"ad928579e25d9ea2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1f76d7169bd6833b","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TupleVal}_{93}(\\bar a;\\bar x,n)$ is the assignment graph defined here; $\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}$ is the recursion of [[93-df-deterministic]]."},{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-7","locat